  CellName: Hedgerow
  Description: 'Hedgerow - intensity 1 of Hedgerow: eight low hedges close to the core - room to learn
    the stop. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u), no environment, no flora
    and no fauna. The field (8 hedges of 32 x 2 bricks, 512 prisms in all, 744 u out) is
    laid by HedgerowController. 4 omni crystals respawn inside the nucleus (the scene''s
    CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (11,312 prisms, 814,464 volume).
    Authored by Tools/Build/author_hedgerow_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
